{"title":"2019 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61a7282b9c706c921354344bd50f84d3cd5c1e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x^{2}(1-x)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"19\" />. What is the value of the sum\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc10c8e158e346ff887ab29152c7d1b5a7a5922.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f \\left(\\frac{1}{2019} \\right)-f  \\left(\\frac{2}{2019} \\right)+f \\left(\\frac{3}{2019} \\right)-f \\left(\\frac{4}{2019} \\right)+\\cdots + f \\left(\\frac{2017}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{2018}{2019} \\right)?\\]\" width=\"596\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f39a7c565d2a0422babbb394f9121836aad5d4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\frac{1}{2019^{4}}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{2018^{2}}{2019^{4}}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{2020^{2}}{2019^{4}}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"468\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee4b77f27b5e6bd190067f66981f67ebab863bc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(1-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />. We can see this since \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/210ab2d10107fd29d82e3953bc19115911cd7dce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x) = x^2(1-x)^2 = (1-x)^2x^2 = (1-x)^{2}\\left(1-\\left(1-x\\right)\\right)^{2} = f(1-x)\\]\" width=\"502\" height=\"21\" />\nUsing this result, we regroup the terms accordingly:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/9/b4920afe33917c882c3ea0d6b0594effda45801e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left( f \\left(\\frac{1}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{2018}{2019} \\right) \\right) +  \\left( f \\left(\\frac{2}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{2017}{2019} \\right) \\right) + \\cdots + \\left( f \\left(\\frac{1009}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{1010}{2019} \\right) \\right)\\]\" width=\"684\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/87361380209081cfc0c5667d1224d7c7ce591457.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\left( f \\left(\\frac{1}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{1}{2019} \\right) \\right) +  \\left( f \\left(\\frac{2}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{2}{2019} \\right) \\right) + \\cdots + \\left( f \\left(\\frac{1009}{2019} \\right) - f \\left(\\frac{1009}{2019} \\right) \\right)\\]\" width=\"705\" height=\"43\" />\nNow it is clear that all the terms will cancel out (the series telescopes), so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1ea1f26eedb2d601fdd27e52e6dc0e5f4b4be7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j_APcOIs_p4\">https://youtu.be/j_APcOIs_p4</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B\" title=\"2019 AMC 12B\">2019 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"ht